From 6a77ac18125de09a92f6bc136d6538b263bce106 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mitzev <ogi@kunasystems.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Apr 2026 23:23:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/8] Attributes + repr variants: rustc_cxx_*, rustc_swift_*,
 repr(cpp), repr(swift)

Registers the compiler-internal attributes the rustcc proc macros emit
(#[rustc_cxx_ctor], #[rustc_cxx_virtual], #[rustc_cxx_drop_wrapper],
#[rustc_cxx_base], swift variants), wires them through rustc_hir's
cross-crate encoding tables, and adds the ReprAttr::Cpp / ReprAttr::Swift
layout hints consumed later by the layout bridge. No behavior outside
attribute parsing yet.
